  <metadata>
    <name>Empordà Plain Circuit</name>
    <desc>A gravel exploration of the flat medieval heartland east of Girona. Meanders through Ullastret, Peratallada, Pals, and Torroella de Montgrí on farm tracks and quiet lanes with rice paddies and ruins.</desc>
